  "id": 59,
  "description": "## 🏔️Stay Frosty🏔️\n&quot;When the world burns with haste, we are the calm in the chilling snow.&quot;\n\nA quiet order born from the ancient frost, dedicated to the lost art of the patient journey. Neither the madness of war nor the fever for quick glory can break their pace; they walk in harmony with the gentle rhythms of the realm. Its members are wanderers, quiet observers, wayfarers, and stargazers who savor every sunrise, honor every step, and find solace in the vast beauty of the wilderness. For when empires rush to their ruin and legends burn out too fast, Stay Frosty endures—keeping a cool heart so that the beauty of the road is never forgotten.\n\nEst. April 21st, 2024\n\n### Benefits\n* Daily Raids and Pool Buff.\n* Weekly Premium Membership giveaways. \n* Consumable Sponsorship (Frosty Shop)\n* Helpful community.\n* Guidance Scrolls Living Vending Machine (might not work sometimes)\n\n### Rules\n* Online Inactivity for 3 days period without notice will result in a kick.\n* Guild Activity (Raid/Contribution/Challenge) should be performed daily.\n* Former members may freely re-apply in the future.\n\n### RAID TIMES: \n* (1:45 PM GMT) - Energizing Pool Buff Activation.\n* (2:00 PM GMT) - Isle of Whispers Raid (Combat Lvl. 92).\n\n### Communications\n* Discord - https://discord.gg/p3jzCnEswm (for raid/shooting star pings and giveaways.)\ncontact WastedPk at discord:cr4zh with any questions or inquiries.\n\nWe also have a 2nd guild Imperium of Man for low combat  level character that using the same discord server and everything else.",
